{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"694a737b4b78ed15","type":"text","text":"# Vehicle\n- vehicle_id\n- consumer_id\n- listing_id\n- VIN\n- Year\n- Model\n- Make\n- Transmission\n- Mileage\n- Has_modifications?\n- Has_issues?\n- Location\n- file_id_array[]\n# Relations\n- Consumer: OneToOne\n- Files: OneToMany\n- Listing: OneToOne","x":-240,"y":-1320,"width":410,"height":596},
		{"id":"8dc3ae16a8d044ef","type":"text","text":"# Listing\n- consumer_id\n- listing_id\n- vehicle_id\n- dealer_id_array[]\n- Reserve_price\n- Buy_now_price\n- Auction_duration\n- Auction_Status: enum[<font color=\"#ffff00\">Not_started</font>, <font color=\"#4bacc6\">In_progress</font>, <font color=\"#00b050\">Complete</font>]\n- Reserve_status: enum[<font color=\"#ff0000\">Reserve_Not_Met</font>, <font color=\"#f79646\">Reserver_Nearly_Met</font>, <font color=\"#00b050\">Reserve_Met</font>]\n- Current_highest_bid\n- Winning_dealer(nullable)\n# Relations\n- Consumer: OneToOne or ManyToOne\n- Dealer: OneToMany\n- Vehicle: OneToOne","x":-800,"y":-724,"width":450,"height":580},
		{"id":"f3f4990fa06decce","type":"text","text":"# **Files**\n- file_id (PK)\n- vehicle_id (FK → Vehicle.vehicle_id)\n- file_type (image | pdf)\n- file_name\n- file_url \n- mime_type (image/jpeg, application/pdf, etc.)\n- size_bytes\n- uploaded_at\n- is_primary (boolean, e.g. main display photo)\n# Relations\n- Vehicle: ManyToOne","x":391,"y":-724,"width":440,"height":444},
		{"id":"2f77c1d315d01ffd","type":"text","text":"## Process\n- User selects a file (image or PDF) on the Next.js frontend (Mantine FileInput).\n- The frontend calls your NestJS backend asking for a pre-signed upload URL.\n- NestJS generates the pre-signed URL from DigitalOcean Spaces and returns:\n\t- uploadUrl → temporary URL where the file can be uploaded.\n\t- fileUrl → permanent public (or private) file URL in Spaces.\n- The frontend uses axios.put() to upload the file directly to Spaces, bypassing the backend.\n- Once upload succeeds, the frontend calls your NestJS /files endpoint to save file metadata (vehicle_id, file_url, mime_type, size, type=image/pdf) into PostgreSQL.\n- The vehicle listing page fetches file metadata from PostgreSQL and displays images/PDF links using the fileUrl.","x":-300,"y":-672,"width":631,"height":392}
	],
	"edges":[
		{"id":"92add8e264af7075","fromNode":"694a737b4b78ed15","fromSide":"left","toNode":"8dc3ae16a8d044ef","toSide":"top"},
